' WOLFS14.BAS - the v1.4 shareware build of the QB64 Wolfenstein 3-D port (*.WL1 data files of
' the shareware v1.4, as on archive.org: wolf3dsw.zip)
' Build it with: qb64 -x WOLFS14.BAS (WOLF1.BAS builds the v1.0 shareware, WOLF3D.BAS the full
' version, *.WL6)
'
' Like WOLF1VER.H, the version header of the original shareware build: UPLOAD is the shareware
' game (episode 1 only). The v1.4 data is what this source was written for, but no header of
' it fits the graphics (see GFXV_S14.BI)
$Let UPLOAD = 1
'$INCLUDE:'WOLF3D.BAS'
